  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Monterey chicken is a flavorful skillet dinner made with tender chicken breasts seared until golden, then topped with colorful bell peppers, onions, and smoky turkey bacon. A splash of chicken broth and apple cider vinegar adds savory depth while keeping the dish bright and balanced. Finished with melty Monterey Jack cheese, Monterey chicken is an easy, comforting meal that delivers bold flavor and cheesy satisfaction in every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-monterey-chicken\">Why You’ll Love This monterey chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-monterey-chicken\">How to Make Monterey Chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-monterey-chicken\">Pro Tips for Making monterey chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-monterey-chicken\">How to Serve this monterey chicken</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-monterey-chicken\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This monterey chicken</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a one-skillet wonder, making cleanup a breeze.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Loaded with cheesy goodness and crispy bacon for a flavor explosion.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick to prepare, perfect for busy weeknights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Versatile—customize with your favorite veggies!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-12114\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"12114\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout